## 4. Forge order (product-owner sequencing)

Not unit order — **evidence order**, so the best-supported units set the standard and the frontier units inherit it.

| Wave  | Units             | Why first                                                                                                                         | Artefact role                 |
| ----- | ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| **1** | **11 · 12**       | Best-supported (Garcia, Nelson & Ponciano, González-Videgaray, Liu verbatim, DEC LATAM). They define the assessment students meet | Release + defence ritual      |
| **2** | **8 · 9 · 10**    | Entrega 2 frontier; the pilot declaration does real work; **carries the vShowroom's 3D core**                                     | 3D viewer, shaders, live data |
| **3** | **2 · 3 · 4 · 7** | Architecture, PWA, performance — the platform beneath the frontier                                                                | Astro shell, offline, budgets |
| **4** | **1**             | Kickoff last: it must promise exactly what the other eleven deliver                                                               | Orientation                   |
| **5** | decks ×12         | After prose settles. A deck for a lesson still in flux is waste                                                                   | —                             |

